  "role": "Ambusher",
  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Free Worlds League's fractious politics have always made centralized BattleMech procurement difficult, pushing the FWLM toward heavy investment in conventional infantry to fill the gaps. Towing crew-served autocannon/20 field guns, these platoons deploy the heaviest conventional direct-fire weapon available to infantry formations. A single AC/20 round can cripple a light vehicle or breach BattleMech armor at short range, though the weapon's bulk limits repositioning.</p>"
